---
layout: base
permalink: /index.html
title: 'Trash Not Slop'
description: 'We believe that human written code is better than AI generated slop.'
blog:
  title: 'Blog'
---

<div class="wrapper">
    <article class="full | region">
        <div class="prose wrapper flow">
            <p>
                Human made things are more interesting than AI generated slop.
            </p>
            <p>
                <em>This website is being made a human, so be patient as it gets going.</em>
            </p>
        </div>
    </article>

    <section class="full | region">
        <div class="prose wrapper flow">
            <h2>{{ blog.title }}</h2>
            {% if blog.intro %}
                <p>{{ blog.intro }}</p>
            {% endif %}
            <div class="feature |  region region-space-l">
                <custom-masonry layout="50-50">
                    {% set itemList = collections.allPosts %}
                    {% asyncEach item in itemList.slice(0, 4) %}
                        {% set headingLevel = "h3" %}
                        {% include "partials/card-blog.njk" %}
                    {% endeach %}
                </custom-masonry>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>
